<title>USA: Florida $100 mln housing agency bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Florida $100 mln housing agency bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced Florida Housing Finance Agency's $100 million bond deal, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top tax-exempt yield in 2029 unchanged at 5.90 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
